                <h1 class="luxury-heading text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white mb-4">
                    Discover Amazing Products
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 mb-6">
                    Explore our curated collection of premium products. Find exactly what you're looking for with our advanced filters and intelligent search.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <span class="luxury-badge">
                        <i class="fas fa-star mr-2"></i>
                        Premium Quality
                    </span>
                    <span class="luxury-badge">
                        <i class="fas fa-shipping-fast mr-2"></i>
                        Fast Delivery
                    </span>
                    <span class="luxury-badge">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-2"></i>
                        Secure Shopping
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
